<p>Choose a question and answer it aloud.</p>

<p><strong>1.</strong> What kind of entertainment do you enjoy?</p>
<p><strong>2.</strong> What is your favourite TV programme?</p>
<p><strong>3.</strong> Which entertainment job would you like to do? Why?</p>
<p>Answer these questions aloud:</p>

<button class="action" onclick="speak('Which entertainment job would you like to do? Why?')">
🔊 Hear the Question
<p>What kind of entertainment do you enjoy?</p>

<p>What is your favourite TV programme?</p>

<p>Which entertainment job would you like to do?</p>

<button class="action"
onclick="speak('Which entertainment job would you like to do?')">
🔊 Hear Question
</button>
</div>

<div class="activity">
<h3>📖 My Learning</h3>
<p>Write one new word you learned today.</p>
<input id="newWord" placeholder="New word">
<button class="action" onclick="saveWord()">Save Word</button>
<div id="savedWord" class="score"></div>
</div>

</section>

